    "description": "The Telecom SIM Swap API enables service providers to facilitate the secure swapping of mobile SIM cards for their customers. This operation allows users to seamlessly transition between SIMs, ensuring continuous service and protecting personal information. Typical consumers of this API include telecom operators and customer service applications that require efficient SIM management solutions. With this API, businesses can streamline processes related to SIM replacement, enhance user experience, and improve customer satisfaction.",
